L1118: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5-chat-latest`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1119: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5-codex`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1120: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5.1-chat-latest`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1121: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5.1-codex`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1122: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5.1-codex-max`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1123: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5.1-codex-mini`  | `gpt-5.6-terra`\nL1124: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-audio-mini-2025-10-06`  | `gpt-audio-1.5`\nL1125: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-realtime-mini-2025-10-06`  | `gpt-realtime-2.1-mini`\nL1126: July 23, 2026  | `o3-deep-research-2025-06-26` | `o3-deep-research`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1127: July 23, 2026  | `o4-mini-deep-research-2025-06-26` | `o4-mini-deep-research`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1128: July 23, 2026  | `gpt-5.2-codex`  | `gpt-5.6-sol`\nL1129: ### 2026-03-24: Sora 2 video generation models and Videos API\nL1130: \nL1131: On March 24th, 2026, we notified developers using the Videos API and Sora 2 video generation model aliases and snapshots of their deprecation and removal from the API on September 24, 2026.\nL1132: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1133: --- | --- | ---\nL1134: 2026-09-24  | Videos API  | —\nL1135: 2026-09-24  | `sora-2`  | —\nL1136: 2026-09-24  | `sora-2-pro`  | —\nL1137: 2026-09-24  | `sora-2-2025-10-06`  | —\nL1138: 2026-09-24  | `sora-2-2025-12-08`  | —\nL1139: 2026-09-24  | `sora-2-pro-2025-10-06`  | —\nL1140: ### 2025-11-18: `chatgpt-4o-latest` snapshot\nL1141: \nL1142: On November 18th, 2025, we notified developers using `chatgpt-4o-latest` model snapshot of its deprecation and removal from the API on February 17, 2026.\nL1143: \nL1144: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1145: --- | --- | ---\nL1146: 2026-02-17  | `chatgpt-4o-latest`  | `gpt-5.1-chat-latest`\nL1147: ### 2025-11-17: `codex-mini-latest` model snapshot\nL1148: \nL1149: On November 17th, 2025, we notified developers using `codex-mini-latest` model of its deprecation and removal from the API on February 12, 2026. As part of this deprecation, we will no longer support our legacy local shell tool, which is only available for use with `codex-mini-latest`. For new use cases, please use our latest shell tool.\nL1150: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1151: --- | --- | ---\nL1152: 2026-02-12  | `codex-mini-latest`  | `gpt-5-codex-mini`\nL1153: ### 2025-11-14: DALL·E model snapshots\nL1154: \nL1155: On November 14th, 2025, we notified developers using DALL·E model snapshots of their deprecation and removal from the API on May 12, 2026.\nL1156: \nL1157: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1158: --- | --- | ---\nL1159: 2026-05-12  | `dall-e-2`  | `gpt-image-2`, `gpt-image-1`, or `gpt-image-1-mini`\nL1160: 2026-05-12  | `dall-e-3`  | `gpt-image-2`, `gpt-image-1`, or `gpt-image-1-mini`\nL1161: ### 2025-09-26: Legacy GPT model snapshots\nL1162: \nL1163: To improve reliability and make it easier for developers to choose the right models, we are deprecating a set of older OpenAI models with declining usage over the next six to twelve months. Access to these models will be shut down on the dates below.\nL1164: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1165: --- | --- | ---\nL1166: 2026-09-28  | `gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct`  | `gpt-5.6-terra`\nL1167: 2026-09-28  | `babbage-002`  | `gpt-5.6-terra`\nL1168: 2026-09-28  | `davinci-002`  | `gpt-5.6-terra`\nL1169: 2026-09-28  | `gpt-3.5-turbo-1106`  | `gpt-5.6-terra`\nL1170: ### 2025-09-26: Legacy GPT model snapshots (March 2026 shutdown)\nL1171: \nL1172: To improve reliability and make it easier for developers to choose the right models, we deprecated a set of older OpenAI models with declining usage. Access to these models was shut down on March 26, 2026.\nL1173: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1174: --- | --- | ---\nL1175: 2026‑03‑26  | `gpt-4-0314`  | `gpt-5` or `gpt-4.1*`\nL1176: 2026‑03‑26  | `gpt-4-1106-preview`  | `gpt-5` or `gpt-4.1*`\nL1177: 2026‑03‑26  | `gpt-4-0125-preview` (including `gpt-4-turbo-preview` and `gpt-4-turbo-preview-completions`, which point to this snapshot)  | `gpt-5` or `gpt-4.1*`\nL1178: \nL1179: *For tasks that are especially latency sensitive and don’t require reasoning\nL1180: ### 2025-09-15: Realtime API Beta\nL1181: \nL1182: The Realtime API Beta was deprecated and removed from the API on May 12, 2026.\nL1183: \nL1184: The interfaces in the Realtime beta API and the released GA API have a few key differences. See cite541†the migration guide for the current GA interface and related Realtime docs.\nL1185: \nL1186: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1187: --- | --- | ---\nL1188: 2026‑05‑12  | OpenAI-Beta: realtime=v1  | Realtime API\nL1189: ### 2025-09-15: `gpt-4o-realtime-preview` models\nL1190: \nL1191: In September, 2025, we notified developers using `gpt-4o-realtime-preview` models of their deprecation and removal from the API in six months.\nL1192: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1193: --- | --- | ---\nL1194: 2026-05-07  | `gpt-4o-realtime-preview`  | `gpt-realtime-1.5`\nL1195: 2026-05-07  | `gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2025-06-03`  | `gpt-realtime-1.5`\nL1196: 2026-05-07  | `gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-12-17`  | `gpt-realtime-1.5`\nL1197: 2026-05-07  | `gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview`  | `gpt-realtime-mini`\nL1198: 2026-05-07  | `gpt-4o-audio-preview`  | `gpt-audio-1.5`\nL1199: 2026-05-07  | `gpt-4o-mini-audio-preview`  | `gpt-audio-mini`\nL1200: ### 2025-08-20: Assistants API\nL1201: \nL1202: On August 26th, 2025, we notified developers using the Assistants API of its deprecation and removal from the API one year later, on August 26, 2026.\nL1203: \nL1204: When we released the cite542†Responses API in cite33†March 2025 , we announced plans to bring all Assistants API features to the easier to use Responses API, with a sunset date in 2026.\nL1205: See the Assistants to Conversations cite55†migration guide to learn more about how to migrate your current integration to the Responses API and Conversations API.\nL1206: \nL1207: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1208: --- | --- | ---\nL1209: 2026‑08‑26  | Assistants API  | Responses API and Conversations API\nL1210: ### 2025-06-10: `gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-10-01`\nL1211: \nL1212: On June 10th, 2025, we notified developers using `gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-10-01` of its deprecation and removal from the API in three months.\nL1213: \nL1214: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1215: --- | --- | ---\nL1216: 2025-10-10  | `gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-10-01`  | `gpt-realtime-1.5`\nL1217: ### 2025-06-10: `gpt-4o-audio-preview-2024-10-01`\nL1218: \nL1219: On June 10th, 2025, we notified developers using `gpt-4o-audio-preview-2024-10-01` of its deprecation and removal from the API in three months.\nL1220: \nL1221: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1222: --- | --- | ---\nL1223: 2025-10-10  | `gpt-4o-audio-preview-2024-10-01`  | `gpt-audio-1.5`\nL1224: ### 2025-04-28: `text-moderation`\nL1225: \nL1226: On April 28th, 2025, we notified developers using `text-moderation` of its deprecation and removal from the API in six months.\nL1227: \nL1228: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1229: --- | --- | ---\nL1230: 2025-10-27  | `text-moderation-007`  | `omni-moderation`\nL1231: 2025-10-27  | `text-moderation-stable`  | `omni-moderation`\nL1232: 2025-10-27  | `text-moderation-latest`  | `omni-moderation`\nL1233: ### 2025-04-28: `o1-preview` and `o1-mini`\nL1234: \nL1235: On April 28th, 2025, we notified developers using `o1-preview` and `o1-mini` of their deprecations and removal from the API in three months and six months respectively.\nL1236: \nL1237: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1238: --- | --- | ---\nL1239: 2025-07-28  | `o1-preview`  | `o3`\nL1240: 2025-10-27  | `o1-mini`  | `o4-mini`\nL1241: ### 2025-04-14: GPT-4.5-preview\nL1242: \nL1243: On April 14th, 2025, we notified developers that the `gpt-4.5-preview` model is deprecated and will be removed from the API in the coming months.\nL1244: \nL1245: Shutdown date  | Model / system  | Recommended replacement\nL1246: --- | --- | ---\nL1247: 2025-07-14  | `gpt-4.5-preview`  | `gpt-4.1`\n"
